  "description": "Fast like a flat-bar road bike, more comfortable than a traditional drop-bar road bike: the Strada Express 24 is designed as a super commuter for daily rides, fitness riding, neighborhood loops, and light mixed-surface use.\n\nFull 24-speed range: the triple crank and 8-speed cassette give a wide range for flats, hills, and loaded commuting.\n\nConfident stopping power: Shimano MT201 hydraulic disc brakes with 160mm rotors offer strong, easy braking in mixed weather.\n\nBuilt for rougher roads: 700x42c Kenda puncture guard tires with reflective sidewalls add comfort, grip, and visibility compared with narrower fitness tires.\n\nUtility ready: the frame and fork include useful mounts for racks, bottles, and top tube storage mount. (bento box not included)",
